      "start_seconds": 1.13,
      "end_seconds": 6.5,
      "duration_seconds": 5.37,
      "text": "hello again. Come on in. You came on your own today?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 7.4,
      "end_seconds": 10.88,
      "duration_seconds": 3.48,
      "text": "yes, I managed on my own"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 12.16,
      "end_seconds": 14.84,
      "duration_seconds": 2.68,
      "text": "tell me what's been troubling you"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 15.73,
      "end_seconds": 19.11,
      "duration_seconds": 3.38,
      "text": "It's swelling in my left calf mostly."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 21.17,
      "end_seconds": 23.2,
      "duration_seconds": 2.03,
      "text": "and when did that start?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 24.02,
      "end_seconds": 35.8,
      "duration_seconds": 11.78,
      "text": "Honestly I can't say exactly when it started. It might have been last month or the month before I really can't pin it down."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 36.26,
      "end_seconds": 46.66,
      "duration_seconds": 10.4,
      "text": "okay, keep going can you describe it a bit more for me? How strong it is, what the pattern is, what helps"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 47.38,
      "end_seconds": 52.64,
      "duration_seconds": 5.26,
      "text": "it just comes and goes. Standing definitely sets it off"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 53.52,
      "end_seconds": 56.68,
      "duration_seconds": 3.16,
      "text": "anything that tends to go along with it?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 57.82,
      "end_seconds": 68.86,
      "duration_seconds": 11.04,
      "text": "yeah when it starts I tend to get a bit of redness as well. The bit of redness? That's been for five days"
